msgid "PyFlow.flow\\_setup module"
msgstr "PyFlow.flow \\_ setupモジュール"

#: 586460f36f3b4654abb0db6b5d77b39d PyFlow.flow_setup.launch_web_tool:1 of
msgid "Launch the transfer_web launcher (``kind`` = \"server\" or \"client\")."
msgstr "Transfer_webランチャー('' kind ''=\" server \"or\" client \")を起動します。"

#: PyFlow.flow_setup.launch_web_tool:3 ef1274ba70124aeeadee3d4cfcca99c2 of
msgid ""
"The web tool is a Flask app that opens a browser UI, so it runs in its own "
"process (a terminal window when one is available, otherwise detached) and "
"the launcher returns immediately."
msgstr ""
"Webツールは、ブラウザーUIを開くFlaskアプリであるため、独自のプロセス（利用可能な場合はターミナルウィンドウ、それ以外の場合は切り離されます）で実行され、ランチャーはすぐに戻ります。"

#: 7086887643164f229f919546dceb0e36
#: PyFlow.flow_setup.edit_existing_instances:1 of
msgid "Vim-style editor to delete/change existing instances."
msgstr "既存のインスタンスを削除/変更するためのVimスタイルエディタ。"

#: PyFlow.flow_setup.edit_existing_instances:3
#: d04ffe1cf853403292908fc69962f7dc of
msgid "Returns (status, servers, clients):"
msgstr "戻り値（ステータス、サーバー、クライアント） ："

#: 5a751731515c4adfba9787fdd5e93215
#: PyFlow.flow_setup.edit_existing_instances:4 of
msgid "status == \"saved\"     -> setup.json was written (:w / :wq); keep the"
msgstr "status ==\" saved \"-> setup.json was written (: w /: wq); keep the"

#: PyFlow.flow_setup.edit_existing_instances:5
#: e61a6437dae14d1e9f9ac4e6848cd444 of
msgid "returned edited lists"
msgstr "が編集したリストを返しました"

#: PyFlow.flow_setup.edit_existing_instances:6
#: bb9424a8ea894dbb888df4fa2e0875ed of
msgid "status == \"discarded\" -> the editor was exited without saving"
msgstr "status == \"discarded\" ->エディターは保存せずに終了しました"

#: PyFlow.flow_setup.edit_existing_instances:7
#: d0d81a426f754475922c3e9f4aee6627 of
msgid "(:q! / :q) and the original lists are returned unchanged"
msgstr "(: q !/: q)元のリストは変更されずに返されます"
